# Rust build output
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo — Cargo.lock IS committed (this crate ships binaries; a locked
# dependency set is required for reproducible release artifacts and the
# CI `--locked` gate). Do NOT ignore it.

# Demo / scratch artifacts produced by `cargo run --json-log ...` and the
# forensic dumps. These are runtime output, never source.
*.jsonl
/spoof_demo.jsonl
spoof-*.json
/dist/
/var-lib-flyingsquirrel/
/var-log-flyingsquirrel/

# SITL validation harness run output (deploy/sitl/run-sitl-validation.*).
# Regenerated every run; never source.
/deploy/sitl/last-run/
/deploy/sitl/last-detector-log.txt

# Python bytecode cache from importing the SITL harness / driver modules.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# cargo-fuzz output. The SEED corpus under fuzz/corpus/ IS committed (it
# bootstraps coverage on a cold CI runner); the mutator's own accumulated
# inputs, build tree, and crash artifacts are not. A crash artifact worth
# keeping gets promoted into a regression test, not committed here.
/fuzz/target/
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/coverage/

# Editor / OS cruft
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
